OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FEarly showers soon giving
OL,6,Fway to a broad area of heavy rain,
OL,7,Fbriefly accompanied by strong winds.
OL,8,FTurning drier and brighter later,
OL,9,Fthough remaining breezy with a few
OL,10,Fcoastal showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,13,Fand sunny on Thursday after a chilly
OL,14,Fstart. Cloud increasing on Friday with
OL,15,Fpatchy rain arriving later. Chilly
OL,16,Fwith early fog on Saturday, then
OL,17,Fbrighter with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
